ed and will be removed in a future release.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It can cause critical application lifecycle issues due to changes in how Apple’s modern User Notification","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delegates operate.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"warning","name":"Warning"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Lifecycle Issues Explained","anchor":"Lifecycle-Issues-Explained"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apple’s modern "},{"code":"async","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" notification delegate methods execute on a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"background thread"}]},{"type":"text","text":" by default instead of a the main"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thread. This creates a race condition during app launch:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Main Thread:"}]},{"text":" Proceeds with the standard launch sequence, making the app’s UI active and visible.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Background Thread:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Runs this notification code. By the time it can switch back to the main"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thread, the app is often already active."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This breaks the critical assumption that code for a “direct open” notification runs "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the app is fully"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interactive. This can lead to incorrect direct open counts."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Migration","anchor":"Migration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To fix this, you must migrate to the synchronous version of this method, which accepts and forwards a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"completionHandler"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This guarantees your code runs on the main thread at the correct point in the lifecycle, before the app becomes active."}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"center: The notification center that delivered the notification."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"response: The user’s response to the notification."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userNotificationCenter(_:didReceive:withCompletionHandler:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"See Also"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipCore\/documentation\/AirshipCore","doc:\/\/com.urbanairship.AirshipCore\/documentation\/AirshipCore\/AppIntegration"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"userNotificationCenter(_:didReceive:)","externalID":"s:11AirshipCore14AppIntegrationC22userNotificationCenter_10didReceiveySo06UNUserfG0C_So22UNNotificationResponseCtYaFZ","platforms":[{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"deprecated":true,"message":"Use the synchronous version with a completionHandler to avoid lifecycle issues."}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"userNotificationCenter"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UNUserNotificationCenter","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)UNUserNotificationCenter"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"didReceive"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UNNotificationResponse","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)UNNotificationResponse"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"ki